WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Before the costly mistake. Give staff a safe place to practise real receiving decisions.

2
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Know the task. Check the evidence. Read the delivery note. Receive eight cartons at BrightMart Mini Store.

3
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Inspect before you accept. Check packaging, product labels, batch and expiry. Isolate damaged, expired or mismatched physical stock.

4
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Count what actually arrived. Expected 24. Actual 22. Accept 22 sound units and record a shortage of 2. Missing units are not quarantine stock.

5
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Review. Then confirm. Reconcile each receiving line. Keep shortages and overages separate. Explicit confirmation saves the report.

6
00:00:50.000 --> 00:01:00.000
A score. A next step. Review accuracy, exceptions, process and efficiency. Get two coaching priorities. Repeat the lesson or try a harder delivery.
